      "index": 1,
      "type": "question",
      "text": "GPT-6 SolとLunaを業務で使い分けるなら、何を基準にしますか。",
      "audio": "interview-question-01.mp3",
      "audioHash": "ab9a3f20e6377e61b6a70f035f68f04f79431f57b07075195e81abf7ce98f68a",
